    "preamble": "George Joseph vs Parambra Grama Panchayath on 11 January, 2024 Author: P. V. Kunhikrishnan Bench: P.V.Kunhikrishnan In The High Court Of Kerala At Ernakulam Present The Honourable Mr. Justice P.V.Kunhikrishnan Thursday, The 11Th Day Of January 2024 / 21St Pousha, 1945 Wp(C) No. 31536 Of 2015 Petitioner: George Joseph, Aged 44 Years S/O.Jose, Kunnappillil House, Eravattur P O, Perambra, Kozhikode District By Advs. Sri.P.P.Thajudeen Sri.Mansoor.B.H. Sri.P.M.Mohammed Hassan Respondents: 1 Perambra Grama Panchayath, Perambra, Kozhikode District, Pin 673525, Rep By Its Secretary 2 Environmental Engineer Kerala State Pollution Control Board, District Office, Kozhikode 673525 3 Balan, Karungottu Meethal, Eravattoor P O, Perambra, Kozhikode 673525 4 Balan K V, Aged 50 Years, S/O.Kunhikkannan, Residing At Kundumkara Vathukkal (H), Eravattoor P O, Perambra, Kozhikode District [Addl R4 Impleaded As Per Order Dated 17.02.16 In I.A.16778/15] By Advs. Sri.P.C.Sasidharan Sri. T.Naveen Sc, Kerala State Pollution Control Board, Sri.Mohanan V.T.K. This Writ Petition (Civil) Having Come Up For Admission On 11.01.2024, The Court On The Same Day Delivered The Following : W.P(C).31536/2015 2 P. V. Kunhikrishnan, J. George Joseph vs Parambra Grama Panchayath on 11 January, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/11789872/ 1 ------------------------------------------- W.P(C).No.31536 of 2015 ------------------------------------------- Dated this the 11th day of January, 2024 Judgment The above Writ Petition is filed with the following prayers: 1.To call for the records leading to Ext P4 and to quash the same by issuing a writ of Certiorari.",
    "facts": "When the matter came up for consideration, this Court passed an interim stay of the operation of Ext.P4 and that order is in force even now.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
